  "description": "The Scrub is our answer to fat jump lines and downhill tracks. It offers everything you could wish for as a gravity fan – double bridge and coil shock with massive travel, powerful brakes and the right DH geometry. The basis of the Scrub is its robust aluminium frame, which impresses with well thought-out details and high-quality workmanship. In addition, adapted chainstay lengths ensure a balanced riding feel in every frame size. Thanks to the mullet concept, you can expect a bike that is both playful and agile on narrow trails, as well as capable of top speed on rough DH lines. With the tried and tested Acros angle headset, you can adjust the head angle by 1° and thus adapt the SCRUB even better to your individual needs. ¹ approx. 18.6 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for Cherry frame, size M, without pedals",
